        "eyebrow": "Why Tailorbird",
        "heading": "Stitched by hand, one bead at a time",
        "text": "<p>The tailorbird is a tiny songbird that stitches leaves together to build its nest, one patient stitch at a time. I make jewellery the same way. Every piece is stitched by hand from natural stone, clay and glass, so no two are quite alike and each is made to last.</p><p>I hope yours feels like it was made just for you, because it was.</p>",
